upsert_all

upsert_all = INSERT + UPDATE

Agar record exist nahi karta → INSERT

Agar unique constraint ke according record already exist karta hai → UPDATE

User.upsert_all([
  { email: "shankar@gmail.com", name: "Shankar" },
  { email: "rahul@gmail.com", name: "Rahul" }
], unique_by: :email)


insert_all is used to bulk insert multiple records efficiently, while upsert_all performs a bulk insert-or-update operation based on a unique constraint. Both bypass ActiveRecord validations and callbacks.


